# {{.Name}}

An [orm](https://github.com/shibisty/orm.go) driver.

```bash
gtr add github:<owner>/<repo>
```

```go
import (
	"orm"
	{{.Package}} "{{.Name}}"
)

conn, err := orm.New(ctx, {{.Package}}.Driver(dsn))
```

Development:

```bash
gtr install                                   # orm comes from devDependencies
gtr run test
ORM_TEST_{{.EnvName}}_DSN=... gtr run test:integration   # the shared orm/drivertest suite
```

orm is a peer dependency (`^0.1`): the application chooses the orm version,
and every driver uses the same one.
